1) Login into the Account, Go to Setting => go to Security Tab 
2) Enable the TFA for the account.
3) Logout from the account.
4) Try to login in and enter random TFA code.
5) You can see in the response that the key is invalid one.
6) So go to the Forget Password option in Login page.
7) Enter the email and click on send reset password link.
8) After that go to email and click on the link, reset the password.
9) And Now to try to login you can see that their is no TFA code entering option in the browser.
10) As it redirect to the user account.
11) Now you can disable the TFA option.
